# Clean Architecture Layer Rules

## Layer Responsibilities

| Layer | Contains | Must NOT contain |
|-------|----------|------------------|
| `Domain` | Entities, enums | Business logic, external deps |
| `Application` | DTOs, interfaces, services, validators, AutoMapper | DB access, HTTP, file IO |
| `Infrastructure` | DbContext, repositories, JWT gen, BCrypt, CsvHelper | Business rules |
| `API` | Controllers, middleware, Program.cs | Business logic, direct DB access |

## Dependency Direction

`API → Application + Infrastructure → Domain`. Domain has zero external references.

## Package Placement

- Database/EF Core, BCrypt, CsvHelper, JWT **generation** → Infrastructure
- JWT **validation** (JwtBearer), Serilog, Swagger → API
- AutoMapper, FluentValidation → Application

## Data & Security Rules

- Soft delete only (`IsDeleted` flag) — never hard-delete financial records
- FK delete behavior: `Restrict` (never Cascade)
- `decimal` for money; `DateTimeOffset` for timestamps; `DateOnly` for filter dates
- `UserId` from JWT claims only — never from request body
- Throw `NotFoundException`, `ConflictException`, `UnauthorizedException` from services
- GlobalExceptionMiddleware maps exceptions to HTTP status codes

## Adding Features

New entity flow: Domain entity → Application DTOs + validator + service interface → Infrastructure repository → API controller.

Migrations: `dotnet ef migrations add Name --project ExpenseManager.Infrastructure --startup-project ExpenseManager.API`
